@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5001

### Saúde
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Criar hóspede
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hospedes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Oliveira",
  "cpf": "11122233344",
  "telefone": "48988887777",
  "email": "maria@exemplo.com",
  "endereco": "Rua das Flores, 50"
}

### Listar hóspedes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospedes

### Buscar hóspede por ID (ajuste o ID se necessário)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hospedes/1

### Atualizar hóspede
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hospedes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "telefone": "48977776666"
}

### Excluir hóspede
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/hospedes/1
